{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waffle Spin Ball is a wild, fast-paced pinball-style arcade game with a delicious twist! Wafle Spin Ball now has two game modes, Pinball and Paddleball each game mod allows you to battle through 5 worlds and 25 uniquely designed levels packed with chaos, challenge, and charm as you bounce, spin, and smash your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 10 distinct characters, each bringing their own flavor to the flipper-fueled or paddle-fueled frenzy. Whether you're mastering the art of timing or just trying to keep your ball alive, you'll find plenty to keep you coming back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect game-changing power-ups and avoid the dreaded power-downs as the action ramps up with each level. Want an extra edge? Uncover hidden cheats and unlock secret abilities to turn the tables!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for glory with your local high score or aim for the global spotlight with a networked high score leaderboard that ranks the top 5 players worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830000?t=1757683612","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830000/c20ad3a0dcf64bbd391ef7d11b66632244687a9f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757683612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830000/343bc3eff200566cea2e58eea852db7d423f15ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757683612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830000/343bc3eff200566cea2e58eea852db7d423f15ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757683612","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waffle Spin Ball is a wild, fast-paced pinball-style arcade game with a delicious twist! Wafle Spin Ball now has two game modes, Pinball and Paddleball each game mod allows you to battle through 5 worlds and 25 uniquely designed levels packed with chaos, challenge, and charm as you bounce, spin, and smash your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 10 distinct characters, each bringing their own flavor to the flipper-fueled or paddle-fueled frenzy. Whether you're mastering the art of timing or just trying to keep your ball alive, you'll find plenty to keep you coming back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect game-changing power-ups and avoid the dreaded power-downs as the action ramps up with each level. Want an extra edge? Uncover hidden cheats and unlock secret abilities to turn the tables!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for glory with your local high score or aim for the global spotlight with a networked high score leaderboard that ranks the top 5 players worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Waffle Street Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830000/27e9650b56d67eb9ed0a77fe3a2be9cbcd89f935/header.jpg?t=1757683612","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 1.x<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 3.78<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum"